WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,740
Grandpa, I can’t walk anymore. I need a hug.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:10,490
Jiaojiao, hold on a little longer, we’re almost there

3
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,890
My old problems with back pain have disappeared.

4
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:14,890
Why did that person relapse as soon as he came back?

5
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,490
Good grandpa sad

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:21,150
Old man, what should we do if you really say something because of a big issue?

7
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,550
There must be a road before the car reaches the mountain

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:25,150
After all, we stay with the family and won’t treat him materially badly.

9
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,750
Put people abroad or in other cities

10
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,550
Give me more money and find someone to take care of me.

11
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:29,950
It can be considered that all the hostages have been taken away.

12
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,550
The eighty-eighth day of missing my wife

13
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,150
The farthest distance in the world

14
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,750
It’s me in this tank and you in the next tank.

15
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:39,350
Xiaoyu Xiaoyu, do you want to go see your wife?

16
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:41,620
You can understand what I'm saying, right?

17
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,220
The Great Merciful and Compassionate Female Bodhisattva

18
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,220
Please take me to the water tank next door

19
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:49,000
Don't shoot me, stay away from me

20
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,200
I don't agree with the breakup, that means there is no breakup

21
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:53,630
My wife is already pregnant with Xiaoyuzi

22
00:00:53,630 --> 00:01:02,020
What have you not given up on yet?

23
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:05,020
Xiaoyu Xiaoyu, do you really not want to live?

24
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:07,220
Then I’ll take you home and feed it to Mimi.
